  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 56 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^24 + x^25 + x^31 + x^32, b(x) = x^15 + x^20 + x^36 + x^41 in F_2[x]/(x^56 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^56 - 1)",
